Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 07:59:16 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?arm64:=20dts:=20exynos:=20gs101:=20throttle=20t?=
 =?UTF-8?q?he=20CPUs=20from=2075=20=C2=B0C?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Under a busy shell the Pixel 6 Pro's big cluster reached the 110 °C
critical trip and the phone shut down: the CPU zones only began to
throttle at 85 °C. Move the three CPU zones' passive trips to 75 and
85 °C. The critical trips stay at 110 °C.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: saiththerobo <the.tom.sharp@gmail.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101.dtsi | 12 ++++++------
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101.dtsi
index ff9018c20..bf3a00cb4 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101.dtsi
@@ -2111,14 +2111,14 @@ big-thermal {
 
 			trips {
 				big_hot: big-hot {
-					temperature = <85000>;
+					temperature = <75000>;
 					hysteresis = <5000>;
 					type = "passive";
 				};
 
 				/* a fast burst outruns step_wise: throttle deep at once */
 				big_hotter: big-hotter {
-					temperature = <95000>;
+					temperature = <85000>;
 					hysteresis = <5000>;
 					type = "passive";
 				};
@@ -2152,14 +2152,14 @@ mid-thermal {
 
 			trips {
 				mid_hot: mid-hot {
-					temperature = <85000>;
+					temperature = <75000>;
 					hysteresis = <5000>;
 					type = "passive";
 				};
 
 				/* a fast burst outruns step_wise: throttle deep at once */
 				mid_hotter: mid-hotter {
-					temperature = <95000>;
+					temperature = <85000>;
 					hysteresis = <5000>;
 					type = "passive";
 				};
@@ -2193,14 +2193,14 @@ little-thermal {
 
 			trips {
 				little_hot: little-hot {
-					temperature = <85000>;
+					temperature = <75000>;
 					hysteresis = <5000>;
 					type = "passive";
 				};
 
 				/* a fast burst outruns step_wise: throttle deep at once */
 				little_hotter: little-hotter {
-					temperature = <95000>;
+					temperature = <85000>;
 					hysteresis = <5000>;
 					type = "passive";
 				};
